# 本文件与 docs/security-boundaries.md 第 6 节保持一致，新增敏感产物类型时两处同步更新。

# Kubernetes / kubeadm 敏感产物
*.kubeconfig
kubeconfig
.kube/
**/admin.conf
**/super-admin.conf
**/pki/
*.crt
*.key
*.csr
*.pem
*.token
join-command.txt
certificate-key.txt

# Ansible 凭据与 Inventory Secret
inventory/**/secrets.yml
inventory/**/vault.yml
vault_pass*
*.vault
.ansible-vault

# 实验产物与日志
artifacts/
logs/
*.log

# Python / Node（CI 与本地工具）
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
venv/
node_modules/
dist/

# IDE / 系统
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.tmp